  m_text: "Cobalt Strike is a command and control (C2) software. With it, hackers
    and security professionals can coordinate attacks on their targets.\n\nIts most
    well-known feature is the \"Beacon\", a stealthy agent that communicates with
    the attacker and can execute commands, download/upload files, or move through
    a compromised network. \r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
